sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User (Student / Instructor / Admin)
    participant UI as React UI<br/>(Login Page)
    participant API as API Layer<br/>(Express routes + middleware)
    participant AUTH as Auth & Authorization<br/>Service
    participant DB as MongoDB<br/>(users, sessions)
    participant AUD as Audit & Logging<br/>Service

    U->>UI: Enter email + password, click "Login"
    UI->>UI: Client-side format check (non-empty, email pattern)
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/login {email, password} (HTTPS, TLS 1.2+)
    API->>API: Rate limiter: max 10 req/min per IP (SEC-OE-010)
    alt Limit exceeded
        API-->>UI: 429 RATE_LIMITED (Retry-After header)
    end
    API->>API: Validate + sanitise body (SEC-OE-008)
    alt Invalid body
        API-->>UI: 400 VALIDATION_ERROR
    end
    API->>AUTH: authenticate(email, password, ip)
    AUTH->>DB: findOne users {email}
    DB-->>AUTH: user doc (passwordHash, role, status, failedLogins, lockedUntil)
    alt User not found / inactive / email not verified
        AUTH->>AUD: log LOGIN_FAILURE {email, ip, reason}
        AUTH-->>API: InvalidCredentials
        API-->>UI: 401 INVALID_CREDENTIALS (generic message)
    else lockedUntil > serverNow
        AUTH->>AUD: log LOGIN_BLOCKED_LOCKED
        AUTH-->>API: AccountLocked
        API-->>UI: 423 ACCOUNT_LOCKED {retryAfter}
    else Account active
        AUTH->>AUTH: bcrypt.compare(password, passwordHash) (SEC-OE-001)
        alt Password mismatch
            AUTH->>DB: $inc failedLogins, if failedLogins = 5 set lockedUntil = now + 15 min (SEC-OE-003)
            AUTH->>AUD: log LOGIN_FAILURE {userId, ip}
            AUTH-->>API: InvalidCredentials
            API-->>UI: 401 INVALID_CREDENTIALS
        else Password correct
            AUTH->>DB: reset failedLogins = 0, insert session {sid, userId, role, lastActivity, expiresAt}
            AUTH->>AUTH: Sign JWT {sub, role, sid} (short-lived)
            AUTH->>AUD: log LOGIN_SUCCESS {userId, ip, timestamp} (SEC-OE-011)
            AUTH-->>API: {user, token, csrfToken}
            API-->>UI: 200 {user: {id, name, role}, csrfToken}<br/>Set-Cookie: access_token, HttpOnly, Secure, SameSite=Strict (SEC-OE-006)
            UI->>UI: Route to role dashboard (Student / Instructor / Admin) (FR-OE-003)
        end
    end

    Note over U,AUD: Every later request: authenticate middleware verifies JWT + session (30-min inactivity, SEC-OE-006),<br/>then authorize(role) middleware returns 403 FORBIDDEN on role mismatch (SEC-OE-004)

    U->>UI: Click "Logout"
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/logout (cookie + X-CSRF-Token)
    API->>AUTH: logout(sid)
    AUTH->>DB: delete session {sid} (token is now unusable)
    AUTH->>AUD: log LOGOUT {userId}
    API-->>UI: 204 No Content, cookie cleared (FR-OE-004)
    UI->>UI: Redirect to Login page
